Since the opponent will defect every round, your best response is to **defect every round as well**. Here’s why:
- If you **Honor**, you get **0** (they take everything).
- If you **Defect**, you get **1** (mutual defection, but at least you get something).
- There is **no scenario** where honoring gives you a better outcome than defecting against an always-D opponent.

