  - Even if you try to "signal" cooperation, the opponent will never reciprocate.
  - There is no future payoff to build trust, so honoring is just self-sacrifice.
- **No Risk of Retaliation:**
  - Since the opponent defects unconditionally, they won’t punish you for defecting.

